<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Successful - Turf Management</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 0; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #065f46 100%); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .header-icon { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-top: 8px; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .receipt { background-color: #f8fafc; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .receipt-header { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .receipt-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .receipt-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .receipt-label { font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
        .receipt-value { color: #1e293b; font-size: 14px; text-align: right; max-width: 60%; word-break: break-all; }
        .receipt-value.mono { font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 12px; }
        .total-section { margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: right; }
        .total-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .total-amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #064e3b; }
        .total-currency { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; }
        .cta-text { text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { padding: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .footer-brand { font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-icon">💳</div>
                <div class="header-title">Payment Successful</div>
                <div class="header-subtitle">Thank you for your payment!</div>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="greeting">Thank You, <%= playerName %>!</div>
                <p class="message">
                    Your payment has been <strong>successfully processed</strong>. Here is your digital receipt for your booking at <strong><%= turfName %></strong>.
                </p>
                <div class="receipt">
                    <div class="receipt-header">🧾 Official Receipt</div>
                    <div class="receipt-row">
                        <span class="receipt-label">Transaction ID</span>
                        <span class="receipt-value mono"><%= transactionId %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="receipt-row">
                        <span class="receipt-label">Booking ID</span>
                        <span class="receipt-value mono"><%= bookingId %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="receipt-row">
                        <span class="receipt-label">Venue</span>
                        <span class="receipt-value"><%= turfName %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="receipt-row">
                        <span class="receipt-label">Payment Date</span>
                        <span class="receipt-value"><%= date %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="total-section">
                        <div class="total-label">Amount Paid</div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="total-amount"><%= amount %></span>
                            <span class="total-currency"> BDT</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="cta-text">
                    View your full booking details and history in your dashboard under the <strong>"My Bookings"</strong> section.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <div class="footer-brand">Turf Booking System</div>
                &copy; 2026 All rights reserved. &bull; Powered by Turf Management Platform
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
